
Package: victransport
Title: Explore Victorian Public Transport Patronage
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Waranya", "Ratirotjanakul",
           email = "wrat0001@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interactive Shiny application for exploring
    average daily public transport patronage in Victoria, Australia.
    Users can investigate patronage patterns across transport modes,
    days of the week, day types, and reporting periods through
    interactive visualisations, summary statistics, and dynamically
    generated key findings. The package also includes a prepared
    patronage dataset and functions for summarising patronage data.
